      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "3. Petitioner is alleged to have established consensual physical relationship with the prosecutrix who is a widow lady on the pretext of marriage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 839,
      "end": 986,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Later on, he refused to marry her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 987,
      "end": 1021,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Petitioner is also alleged to have enticed the Informant to hand over Rs. 60,000/- to him.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1022,
      "end": 1112,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "4. Considering the fact that the parties were in consensual physical relationship, petitioner, above named, is directed to be released on bail on furnishing bail bonds of Rs. 20,000/- (Rupees twenty thousand) with two sureties of the like amount each, to the satisfaction of Miss Poonam Kumari,\nlearned Judicial Magistrate, 1st Class, Gumla in connection with Sisai P.S. Case No. 52 of 2024.",
